ed for segmentation tasks, supporting instance-level segmentation with instance segmentation labels in a large number of classes. ; A dataset used for training and evaluating models in few-shot segmentation tasks. ; A dataset used for few-shot segmentation. ; A dataset used for training and fine-tuning models. ; A dataset used for few-shot semantic segmentation. ; A few-shot segmentation method. ; A method used for few-shot segmentation, demonstrating potential in instance segmentation tasks. ; The first few-shot segmentation dataset emphasizing class diversity rather than dataset size.\n']split_entities: text_tokens=3580, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=5920, number_of_entities=102, avg_entity_tokens=36, max_entities=164, num_groups=1, entities_per_group=[102]
